ming, my app switch to background or iphone go to sleep for a while. Then I switch my app to foreground or wake up the iphone, this problem happened.\r\n\r\ncurl_multi_poll return immediatly and curl_multi_info_read returned msg is null, my multi perform thread fall into a infinite loop.\r\n(curl_multi_perform returnd running_handles is not 0)\r\n\r\n### I expected the following\r\n\r\nIs there a way to solve this problem?  My app needs to do some requests when switch to background, and this not appear on other plateforms.\r\n\r\n### curl/libcurl version\r\n7.80.0\r\n[curl -V output]\r\n\r\n### operating system\r\nIOS\r\n<!-- On Unix please post the output of \"uname -a\" -->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/8634/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/8634/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"rcombs","id":819638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTYzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/819638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs","html_url":"https://github.com/rcombs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcombs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-25T13:59:16Z","updated_at":"20